<title>JAPAN: Shin-Keisei Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shin-Keisei Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.61		vs	   10.86</p>
<p> Operating	    1.14		vs	    1.21</p>
<p> Current	    812 million	 vs	  830 million</p>
<p> Net		  417 million	 vs	  379 million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.57 yen	  vs	    6.88 yen</p>
<p> Shares		55 million	 vs	   55 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shin-Keisei Electric Railway Co Ltd is an affiliate of Keisei Electric Railway.</p>
</text>
